Cross-check against results/wesad_55plus_ecg_loso.txt (the file this run's ExtraTrees is meant to reproduce): that file prints BL=1121 (S10), BL=1116 (S15), BL=1085 (S2), etc. -- IDENTICAL to the leading_run_BL counts above. This is strong evidence the label-based/leading-run function (not the fixed-n=8 protocol variant) is what produced that reference number.

